{"id":"9a63c990f1580982","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-definable.md","title":"Definable Subset","display":"df-definable — Definable Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-definable","aliases":["58-df-definable"],"display":"df-definable — Definable Subset","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-definable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-definable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-definable — Definable Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A,X\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal L,\\mathfrak A,X\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (structure, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span> (structure universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span> (selected valuation and satisfaction recursion, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span> and assignment update (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S\\)</span> (definable-subset predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(X,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,x,\\varphi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\bigl(a\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}definable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{DefinableSubset}_S(X,\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L)\n\\land X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\exists\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},s,x,\\varphi\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\n\\land\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathfrak A,s)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\n\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L)\n\\land\\forall a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n\\bigl(a\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\varphi,s[x\\mapsto a])\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Def}(\\mathfrak{A})\">\\(\\mathrm{Def}(\\mathfrak{A})\\)</span> is the set of all subsets of the carrier definable by a first-order formula with parameters encoded by the base assignment <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span>; the satisfaction recursion is an explicit witness rather than an unselected meta-level symbol.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.